    <!-- Story -->

    <section class="about-section">

        <h2>Who We Are</h2>

        <p>

           SpaniCentral is a South African online job platform dedicated to
            connecting job seekers with genuine employment opportunities.
            Our goal is to simplify the job search process by providing one
            trusted place where users can discover internships,
            learnerships, graduate programmes, entry-level positions and
            general jobs across South Africa.

        </p>

        <p>

            We understand how challenging finding employment can be,
            especially for graduates and first-time job seekers.
            That's why we are committed to making career opportunities
            easily accessible to everyone.

        </p>

    </section>

